<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Monday it lowered its rating on the shares of Norfolk Southern Corp to a neutral from an outperform.  </p>
<p>-- further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock shed 1-7/16 to 107-3/16.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
